{"nodes": [{"id": "frontend_design", "label": "React Interface Design Spec (\u0637\u0631\u062d \u0631\u0627\u0628\u0637 React)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "frontend/DESIGN.md", "source_location": "L1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Calm, precise dark interface for daily GRC work (layered dark surfaces, thin lines, one violet accent, soft glow behind each page's main element), with equivalent light theme and 'follow system'; Persian, RTL, Jalali dates."}, {"id": "frontend_design_semantic_color_tokens", "label": "Semantic Color Role Tokens (canvas, panel, surface, accent, ...)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "frontend/DESIGN.md", "source_location": "L10", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "All colors defined only in src/styles/index.css; components know only role names (bg-panel, text-muted, border-line). data-theme on <html> is set by ThemeProvider and read from stored preference before render to avoid flicker. Light warning/success are darker than Tailwind defaults to pass axe contrast in both themes."}, {"id": "frontend_design_method_level_colors", "label": "Risk Level Colors from Method Version", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "frontend/DESIGN.md", "source_location": "L37", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Level colors are data from the method version; LevelBadge shows them only on dot/border and always writes the level name so color is never the only cue; applied via React style (CSSOM) so it works under CSP without unsafe-inline."}, {"id": "frontend_design_typography", "label": "Typography (Inter + Vazirmatn, Persian digits)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "frontend/DESIGN.md", "source_location": "L43", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Self-hosted variable fonts (no CDN); 12/14/15px scale with 1.65-1.8 line height for Persian; fluid clamp headings; Persian digits via Intl.NumberFormat('fa-IR') while codes and usernames stay Latin LTR with .code and <bdi>."}, {"id": "frontend_design_method_stage_navigation", "label": "Navigation Groups Mirroring Method Stages", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "frontend/DESIGN.md", "source_location": "L52", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Menu names the method's stages (desk, identification, assessment, treatment, questionnaire, catalog, administration) so readers of the method document know where each page lives; groups defined in apps/api/session.py and mirrored by templates/base.html. Only simple-count queues show unread badges."}, {"id": "frontend_design_responsive_layout", "label": "Responsive Layout (collapsible RTL sidebar, container-query tables)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "frontend/DESIGN.md", "source_location": "L73", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Sidebar collapses to icons (persisted in localStorage) and becomes a drawer below 1024px; --gutter plus safe-area insets; tables turn into stacked cards below 44rem via container query except data-matrix tables that keep scrolling with sticky first column."}, {"id": "frontend_design_dossier_pattern", "label": "Dossier Layout Pattern (Section, DossierLayout, SectionNav, DocSection)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "frontend/DESIGN.md", "source_location": "L91", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Every record (risk, assessment, service, control, plan, action, acceptance, evidence, response, review) uses one layout: header, card Sections, sticky side column with section list and Facts. Assessment dossier sections follow method order: result, scope and assumptions, impact (I), likelihood (L), quality review; decision level is highlighted at the top."}, {"id": "frontend_design_ui_component_library", "label": "Radix-based UI Component Library", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "frontend/DESIGN.md", "source_location": "L121", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Components in src/components/ui built on Radix with Lucide icons, each with normal/hover/focus/disabled/busy/error states; dialogs trap and return focus (useReturnFocus); ConfirmDialog focuses Cancel first; Jalali DatePicker follows WAI-ARIA APG grid pattern with conversion matching Django jdatetime over 21,900 days; AppLink vs ClassicLink route to SPA or classic Django pages."}, {"id": "frontend_design_django_bridge_single_source", "label": "Single Source of Rules via Django Bridge", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "frontend/DESIGN.md", "source_location": "L167", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "/api/forms/?path= and /api/pages/?path= run the same Django view and return its form and data as JSON, so access control, validation, messages, audit and redirect stay in Django and are not duplicated in the UI; only allow-listed paths (bridge_pages.py) are accepted. Zod rules are only earlier feedback."}, {"id": "frontend_design_multi_form_impact_profile", "label": "Multi-form Page for Impact Profile (FORM_SETS)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "frontend/DESIGN.md", "source_location": "L180", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Each stakeholder x dimension is its own prefixed Django form (datin-S, 12-F); the bridge returns prefixed field names and merges all errors, and the UI renders them as one form grouped by stakeholder with rows named 'dimension, stakeholder' for screen readers."}, {"id": "frontend_design_bridge_actions", "label": "One-Button Bridge Actions with ConfirmDialog", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "frontend/DESIGN.md", "source_location": "L189", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Submit, approve, return, refer, delete path, sign, cancel etc. post via useBridgeAction to the same Django view; irreversible actions are confirmed first; a button exists only when Django permitted it and supplied its URL."}, {"id": "frontend_design_url_synced_filters", "label": "Filters as Django Filter Forms Synced to URL", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "frontend/DESIGN.md", "source_location": "L210", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Each list's filter form is the Django filter form and its values live in the page URL so SPA and Django pages interpret filters identically; defaults via filters.defaults, 'all' is an empty parameter."}, {"id": "frontend_design_motion", "label": "Motion Guidelines (140-240ms, reduced motion)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "frontend/DESIGN.md", "source_location": "L218", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "frontend_design_accessibility", "label": "Accessibility Target WCAG 2.2 AA", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "frontend/DESIGN.md", "source_location": "L225", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "axe in Vitest per component/page and in Playwright on desktop/mobile in both themes; skip link first, focus moves to main after navigation, form errors both inline and in a linked summary."}, {"id": "frontend_design_spa_security", "label": "SPA Security (strict CSP with nonce, Trusted Types, no dangerouslySetInnerHTML)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "frontend/DESIGN.md", "source_location": "L231", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Django serves /app/ with strict CSP and Trusted Types; Zod runs without new Function; Radix styles get the nonce; no keys or tokens in the UI, session in HttpOnly cookie, CSRF from cookie to header; localStorage only for theme and menu state; hidden buttons are not a security decision."}, {"id": "frontend_design_frontend_code_structure", "label": "Frontend Code Structure (TanStack Query, react-hook-form + Zod, i18n)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "frontend/DESIGN.md", "source_location": "L244", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Lazy per-route code splitting; state like filter/search/sort/page/tab kept in URL; React Compiler auto-memo requires reading form errors via useFormState/getFieldState and values via useWatch rather than form.formState/form.watch."}], "edges": [{"source": "frontend_design_semantic_color_tokens", "target": "frontend_src_lib_theme_themeprovider", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "frontend/DESIGN.md", "source_location": "L13", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "frontend_design_method_level_colors", "target": "frontend_src_components_ui_level_badge_levelbadge", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "frontend/DESIGN.md", "source_location": "L37", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "frontend_design_method_stage_navigation", "target": "apps_api_session", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "frontend/DESIGN.md", "source_location": "L55", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "frontend_design_method_stage_navigation", "target": "templates_base", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "frontend/DESIGN.md", "source_location": "L55", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "frontend_design_dossier_pattern", "target": "frontend_src_features_records_dossier_section", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "frontend/DESIGN.md", "source_location": "L107", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "frontend_design_dossier_pattern", "target": "fronten